{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44988","headline":"酬秦山人赠别二首 一 · 皎然","name":"酬秦山人赠别二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知君高隐占贤星，卷叶时时注佛经。\n姓被名公题旧里，诗将丽句号新亭。\n来观新月依清室，欲漱香泉护触瓶。\n我有主人江太守，如何相伴住禅灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}